---

This is a deliberate asymmetry from the rest of the repository, which is
MIT-licensed (see the root `LICENSE`). The engine is a vehicle and should be
frictionless to reuse; the catalogue is the commons this project exists to
grow, and CC-BY-SA keeps a modified corpus open rather than letting it be
folded into something closed. See `CONTRIBUTING.md` for what this means in
practice if you are adding or changing a track.
